      "protein powder without soy lecithin",
      "soy free whey protein",
      "soy free vegan protein powder",
      "sunflower lecithin protein powder"
    ],
  }}
  jsonLd={schema}
>
  <article class="relative overflow-hidden">
    <ArticleHeader kicker={"Buyer's Guide"} badge={"Updated November 2026"} author={author} dates={dates} mobileAd={false}>
      <Fragment slot="title">Best Soy-Free Protein Powder</Fragment>
      Soy hides in more protein powders than you would think, mostly as soy lecithin in whey. These are the soy-free picks worth buying on Amazon.
    </ArticleHeader>

    <TableOfContents>
      <a href="#quick-comparison">Quick Comparison</a>
      <a href="#top-picks">Our Top Picks</a>
      <a href="#where-soy-hides">Where Soy Hides</a>
      <a href="#soy-lecithin-allergy">Soy Lecithin and Allergy</a>
