          <p>
            Emulsifier status comes from each label, brand page or label listing at the time of writing. Lecithin sources can change between production runs and even between flavors of the same product, which is the main reason a soy-free buyer has to read every tub rather than every brand. Protein figures vary by flavor. If dairy is also a problem, skip the four whey picks and see our <a href="/best-dairy-free-protein-powder/">best dairy-free protein powder</a> guide.
