                  For most people, Transparent Labs Grass-Fed Whey Isolate, which uses sunflower lecithin and gives 28 g of protein per scoop per the brand. Naked Whey is the budget pick with no lecithin at all, Klean Isolate suits tested athletes, and Vega Sport Premium Protein is the best soy-free option if you also avoid dairy.
                </p>
              </div>
